  29:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       The STM32F3xx device family integrates up to 7 analog comparators COMP1, COMP2...COMP7:
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccuJNwZC.s 			page 2


  30:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The non inverting input and inverting input can be set to GPIO pins.
  31:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           For STM32F3xx devices please refer to the COMP peripheral section in corresponding
  32:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Reference Manual.
  33:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  34:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The COMP output is available using HAL_COMP_GetOutputLevel()
  35:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           and can be set on GPIO pins.
  36:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           For STM32F3xx devices please refer to the COMP peripheral section in corresponding
  37:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Reference Manual.
  38:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  39:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The COMP output can be redirected to embedded timers (TIM1, TIM2, TIM3...).
  40:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           For STM32F3xx devices please refer to the COMP peripheral section in corresponding
  41:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Reference Manual.
  42:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  43:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Each couple of comparators COMP1 and COMP2, COMP3 and COMP4, COMP5 and COMP6 can be combi
  44:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           mode and respectively COMP1, COMP3 and COMP5 non inverting input is used as common non-in
  45:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  46:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) The seven comparators have interrupt capability with wake-up
  47:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           from Sleep and Stop modes (through the EXTI controller):
  48:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP1 is internally connected to EXTI Line 21
  49:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP2 is internally connected to EXTI Line 22
  50:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP3 is internally connected to EXTI Line 29
  51:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP4 is internally connected to EXTI Line 30
  52:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP5 is internally connected to EXTI Line 31
  53:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP6 is internally connected to EXTI Line 32
  54:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           (++) COMP7 is internally connected to EXTI Line 33.
  55:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  56:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           From the corresponding IRQ handler, the right interrupt source can be retrieved with the
  57:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           adequate macro __HAL_COMP_COMPx_EXTI_GET_FLAG().
  58:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  59:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  60:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****             ##### How to use this driver #####
  61:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** ================================================================================
  62:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   [..]
  63:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       This driver provides functions to configure and program the Comparators of all STM32F3xx devi
  64:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  65:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       To use the comparator, perform the following steps:
  66:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  67:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Fill in the HAL_COMP_MspInit() to
  68:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Configure the comparator input in analog mode using HAL_GPIO_Init()
  69:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Configure the comparator output in alternate function mode using HAL_GPIO_Init() to map 
  70:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****            output to the GPIO pin
  71:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) If required enable the COMP interrupt (EXTI line Interrupt): by configuring and enabling
  72:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****            selecting the desired sensitivity level using HAL_GPIO_Init() function. After that enabl
  73:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****            interrupt vector using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() and HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ() functions.
  74:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  75:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Configure the comparator using HAL_COMP_Init() function:
  76:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the inverting input (input minus)
  77:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the non-inverting input (input plus)
  78:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the output polarity
  79:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the output redirection
  80:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the hysteresis level
  81:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the power mode
  82:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (++) Select the event/interrupt mode
  83:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  84:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       -@@- HAL_COMP_Init() calls internally __HAL_RCC_SYSCFG_CLK_ENABLE() in order
  85:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           to enable the comparator(s).
  86:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccuJNwZC.s 			page 3


  87:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) On-the-fly reconfiguration of comparator(s) may be done by calling again HAL_COMP_Init(
  88:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           function with new input parameter values; HAL_COMP_MspInit() function shall be adapted
  89:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           to support multi configurations.
  90:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  91:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Enable the comparator using HAL_COMP_Start() or HAL_COMP_Start_IT() functions.
  92:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  93:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Use HAL_COMP_TriggerCallback() and/or HAL_COMP_GetOutputLevel() functions
  94:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           to manage comparator outputs (events and output level).
  95:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  96:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) Disable the comparator using HAL_COMP_Stop() or HAL_COMP_Stop_IT()
  97:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           function.
  98:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
  99:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) De-initialize the comparator using HAL_COMP_DeInit() function.
 100:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 101:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****       (#) For safety purposes comparator(s) can be locked using HAL_COMP_Lock() function.
 102:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****           Only a MCU reset can reset that protection.
 103:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 104:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 105:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     =============================================
 106:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 107:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 108:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_COMP_REGISTER_CALLBACKS, when set to 1,
 109:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 110:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Use Functions HAL_COMP_RegisterCallback()
 111:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 112:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 113:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 114:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Function HAL_COMP_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 115:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) OperationCpltCallback : callback for End of operation.
 116:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback         : callback for error detection.
 117:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback       : callback for Msp Init.
 118:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback     : callback for Msp DeInit.
 119:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 120:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 121:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 122:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 123:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Use function HAL_COMP_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 124:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      weak function.
 125:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 126:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 127:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      HAL_COMP_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 128:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 129:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 130:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) OperationCpltCallback : callback for End of operation.
 131:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback         : callback for error detection.
 132:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback       : callback for Msp Init.
 133:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback     : callback for Msp DeInit.
 134:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      [..]
 135:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 136:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      By default, after the HAL_COMP_Init() and when the state is HAL_COMP_STATE_RESET
 137:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 138:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      examples HAL_COMP_OperationCpltCallback(), HAL_COMP_ErrorCallback().
 139:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 140:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_COMP_Init()/ HAL_COMP_DeInit() only when
 141:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 142:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 143:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccuJNwZC.s 			page 4


 144:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_COMP_Init()/ HAL_COMP_DeInit()
 145:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 146:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      [..]
 147:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 148:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_COMP_STATE_READY state only.
 149:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 150:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      in HAL_COMP_STATE_READY or HAL_COMP_STATE_RESET state,
 151:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 152:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****     [..]
 153:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 154:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 155:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      using HAL_COMP_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_COMP_DeInit()
 156:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      or HAL_COMP_Init() function.
 157:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      [..]
 158:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 159:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      When the compilation flag USE_HAL_COMP_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 160:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 161:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****      are set to the corresponding weak functions.
 162:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
 163:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   ******************************************************************************
 164:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   */
 165:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c **** 
