1019:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @brief  Return the output level (high or low) of the selected comparator.
1020:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *         The output level depends on the selected polarity.
1021:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *         If the polarity is not inverted:
1022:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is low when the non-inverting input is at a lower
1023:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the inverting input
1024:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is high when the non-inverting input is at a higher
1025:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the inverting input
1026:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *         If the polarity is inverted:
1027:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *           - Comparator output is high when the non-inverting input is at a lower
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccuJNwZC.s 			page 49


1028:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the inverting input
