1030:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   *             voltage than the inverting input
1031:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @param  hcomp  COMP handle
1032:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_comp.c ****   * @retval Returns the selected comparator output level:
